    "title": "Patterson rides high on night one at NFR - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Ben Estlack ,\n1 days ago A few minutes after his opening-round ride at the National Finals Rodeo, saddle bronc rider Weston Patterson was looking for video. “I literally blacked out and don’t remember my ride until the whistle blew,” said Patterson, a Clarendon College alumnus and first-time NFR qualifier from Waverly, Kansas. “I got off on the pickup man, got down and just heard the crowd. That was pretty cool.” Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
